!Name: block-keeper
!C Left: p120 block keeper
!C The device places a block in the position below the two copies of
!C Kok's galaxy if the position is empty, but does nothing if the
!C position is already occupied by a block. The device uses a p60
!C glider gun found by David Bell (Feb 1995) and a p30 glider-to-
!C Herschel converter discovered by Paul Callahan (Feb 1997).
!C Dieter Leithner, 17 Mar 1997
!C
!C Right: p46 block keeper
!C Brice Due, 1/2007
!
